  "storySkip": "Skip",
  "story_prologue_1": "A calm morning in Coral Harbor. Octo the octopus and Tok the turtle carpenter are fixing a small boat.",
  "story_prologue_2": "The golden flagship appears and Goldfin shatters the Heart of the Sea. The sky darkens and a storm rises.",
  "story_prologue_3": "The waves wreck our boat. Tok: “It's okay. We'll build a new one with our own hands!”",
  "story_prologue_4": "The Red Claw Patrol blockades the harbor under the excuse of a “pirate crackdown”. The first shard of the broken Heart glows on their flagship.",
  "story_prologue_5": "Octo: “Let's recover all six shards and sail to Golden Isle!” First we break through the patrol blocking the harbor.",
  "story_sea_1_intro_1": "Red Claw Patrol: Tropic Bay is our sea. This is a pirate crackdown, turn your ship around!",
  "story_sea_1_intro_2": "Tok: The first shard is glowing on their flagship. Let's take down the patrol boats one by one and reach it.",
  "story_s1_5_before": "Crab Lieutenant: I'll give you credit for getting this far. But you'll never get through this iron bow!",
  "story_s1_5_after": "Crab Lieutenant: Argh… Retreat to the flagship! The captain won't let you get away with this!",
  "story_s1_12_before_1": "Patrol captain: With the shard's power this cutter never stops. I'll close in and crush you.",
  "story_s1_12_before_2": "Octo: Come closer, then. You'll get a taste of my bombs up close!",
  "story_s1_12_after_1": "Patrol captain: The shard… lost its light. The fleet of Fog Strait will be waiting for you.",
  "story_s1_12_after_2": "Tok: We got the first shard back! The Heart feels a little warmer.",
  "story_s1_12_after_3": "Octo: Next is Fog Strait. The skeletons want to lift their curse with a shard?",
  "tutorial_hint_1": "Tap a pirate card, then pull the pirate on deck backwards to fire",
  "tutorial_hint_2": "Move with the ◀ ▶ buttons. You only go as far as your fuel allows",
  "tutorial_hint_3": "Holes below the waterline mean flooding! Fire Tok at your own ship to repair",
